# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Shuhao Zhang et al. (2024). Exploring the frontiers of condensed-phase chemistry with a general reactive machine learning potential.
#   Nature Chemistry. doi:10.1038/s41557-023-01427-3
#
# Version read: publisher (sha256 cb145aeb76c06e0c...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
