#   artifacts/kg/METHODS.md (registry: artifacts/kg/methods-registry.csv).
# Generated by artifacts/scripts/encode_paper.py from artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/zhang2024exploring.yaml.
#
# Encoding scope: the ANI-1xnr model and its dataset (26,650 periodic
# cells, CP2K BLYP-D3, singlet), generated by more than 50 iterations of
# nanoreactor-driven active learning with query-by-committee selection;
# MD speed. Test errors are in Supplementary Tables 4-5, not in the text
# read. Carbon nucleation, acetylene ring formation, biofuel ignition,
# Miller experiment and methane combustion results are properties.

